`SOC-NET-001 — Periodic outbound traffic / rare destination`
`ATT&CK: T1071`
index=network sourcetype=firewall action=allowed
| bin _time span=5m
| stats count as connection_count earliest(_time) as first_seen latest(_time) as last_seen by host dest_ip
| where connection_count >= 5
| eval RuleId="SOC-NET-001", ATTACK="T1071", Assessment="Requires Investigation", Confidence="Low"
| eval AnalystNote="Correlate destination rarity, DNS, process ownership and approved application behaviour"
